":"muted"},"responsive":{"desktop":true,"tablet":true,"mobile":true,"overrides":[]},"resolved":{"items":[{"id":1,"key":"industrial-automation","title":"Industrial Automation","slug":"industrial-automation","tagline":"Control architecture, robotics, and line integration engineered for uptime.","overview":"Meridian designs and commissions automation systems that connect machines, safety, and production data into one dependable operating layer. We work backwards from the process: cycle time, quality, and maintainability come before hardware selection.","icon":"robot","image":{"id":3,"url":"http://localhost:8000/storage/media/seed/automation.webp","alt":"Industrial robotic arm on an engineering bench","caption":null,"credit":"Auledas","width":1200,"height":971,"focal_x":0.5,"focal_y":0.5,"variants":[{"name":"thumb","url":"http://localhost:8000/storage/media/seed/variants/automation-thumb.webp","width":480,"height":388},{"name":"medium","url":"http://localhost:8000/storage/media/seed/variants/automation-medium.webp","width":800,"height":647}]},"url":"/en/solutions/industrial-automation"},{"id":2,"key":"smart-manufacturing","title":"Smart Manufacturing","slug":"smart-manufacturing","tagline":"Traceability, OEE, and quality intelligence built on the plant floor.","overview":"We turn production data into operating decisions. Our teams connect machines, quality systems, and people with a data model that reflects how the plant actually runs — then prove the value on one line before scaling.","icon":"pulse","image":{"id":2,"url":"http://localhost:8000/storage/media/seed/manufacturing.webp","alt":"Automotive assembly line in a modern factory","caption":null,"credit":"Marek Slusarczyk (Tupungato)","width":1200,"height":800,"focal_x":0.5,"focal_y":0.5,"variants":[{"name":"thumb","url":"http://localhost:8000/storage/media/seed/variants/manufacturing-thumb.webp","width":480,"height":320},{"name":"medium","url":"http://localhost:8000/storage/media/seed/variants/manufacturing-medium.